{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n韓國爆紅無花果麻糬芝士蛋糕\n</p>\n<h2>Bieber 夫婦加持!首爾爆紅蛋糕店</h2>\n<p>Justin Bieber 與 Hailey Bieber 最近成立個人品牌 SKYLRK，並在韓國首爾開設期間限定店。Bieber 夫婦二人在訪韓期間，光顧韓國知名甜點店 DORÉ DORÉ 所出品的「無花果麻糬芝士蛋糕」，現場照片與影片在社交平台上瘋傳後，連 DORÉ DORÉ 主理人都在 IG 上發文表示驚喜，迅速令這款蛋糕成為熱話爆紅！</p>\n<h2>Bieber 夫婦同款無花果麻糬芝士蛋糕</h2>\n<p>DORÉ DORÉ 過去曾憑「彩虹蛋糕」紅遍亞洲，這次將韓式傳統大福麻糬與西式重芝士蛋糕結合： 底部為濃郁順滑的重芝士蛋糕，中層鋪上乳酪忌廉與新鮮無花果醬，頂層擺放新鮮當造無花果肉，最後外層包覆上一層薄透軟糯的大福麻糬皮。麻糬皮食落軟糯具嚼勁，搭配清甜多汁的新鮮無花果，口感整體清新而不甜膩。</p>\n<p>DORÉ DORÉ<br/>\n官方IG：@doredoreofficial</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088222524160_18849167076ae03e329cbd7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088222524160_18849167076ae03e329cbd7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930808839679869_11795925066ae03e344f3c2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930808839679869_11795925066ae03e344f3c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088614667261_2144770176ae03e36a9c2f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088614667261_2144770176ae03e36a9c2f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088845194778_9214841206ae03e38e8b94.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308088845194778_9214841206ae03e38e8b94.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089064789109_19655922376ae03e3ae36b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089064789109_19655922376ae03e3ae36b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089207187252_4444002636ae03e3d1106f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089207187252_4444002636ae03e3d1106f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089542766098_11515787456ae03e4007b8e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179308089542766098_11515787456ae03e4007b8e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：IG@doredoreofficial、IG@missdoredore、IG@lilbieber)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De_Dne-iS0V/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:59.709418+00:00","quality":{"score":2,